1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,980
Another form? I thought you found it.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,830
We did. This lets her sit in with you.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,700
I can wait outside.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,830
No. Stay. I don't want to do this twice.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,960
They got it two days before the shooting. See? Your report's on the list.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,980
Then why does this say it's missing?

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,980
That's what we're asking them to explain.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,680
Send them both. Can they sort it out while we're here?

9
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,550
I took time off for this.

10
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,680
If you need to leave, we can finish this by phone.

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,680
I can't keep leaving work every time you find another page.

12
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:26,530
I'll send them with the appeal. I can't fix their system from here.

13
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:37,530
This tells us they got it. I can't tell you who read it.

14
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,260
Can I use the receipt and the dates? Just those.

15
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,130
Without her name this time.

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:53,830
No name. No voice. Just the receipt and dates.

17
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:06,660
This says the report's missing. You know the doctor who signed it?

18
00:02:07,490 --> 00:02:09,270
No. Ask them.

19
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:29,050
You can use the letter. Leave my name off. I still need them to cover next month.

20
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:42,140
Three clinics, same wording, same mark. What if someone just copied those signatures?

21
00:02:42,490 --> 00:02:47,130
You can't fix that by adding a question mark.

22
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:58,710
Have you called the doctor? The actual doctor, not PR.

23
00:02:59,060 --> 00:03:00,840
Both. Still waiting.

24
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:59,240
Wait. I've got someone saying those signatures are real.

25
00:03:59,590 --> 00:04:02,320
Can they back that up?
